            <h3 id="tlWsClaimTitle" style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;color:var(--t1);margin-top:8px;max-width:560px">The device packaging identifies the imported model and manufacturer lot.</h3>
            <div style="margin-top:22px">
              <div style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--t4);margin-bottom:10px">Claim graph / citation path</div>
              <ClaimFlow />
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:20px">
              <div style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--t4);margin-bottom:10px">Verdict queue</div>
              <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;background:var(--rulesoft);border:1px solid var(--rulesoft);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden">
                <div class="crow" data-ws-row data-id="claim-018" data-note="Reads as a factual identification claim, both the model and the manufacturer lot must appear together in the importer file." data-claim="The device packaging identifies the imported model and manufacturer lot." data-verdict="Supported" data-passage="Importer file IFU-22, page 4 lists model QX-180 and lot range A17–A19 with matching manufacturer references." data-source="IFU-22 / page 4" data-color="#2A55A5" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:13px 16px;background:rgba(58,124,196,.07)">
                  <span style="display:block"><strong style="display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--t1);font-weight:500">The device packaging identifies the imported model and manufacturer lot.</strong><small style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t4)">claim-018 / IFU-22 / page 4</small></span>
                  <span style="flex-shrink:0;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--teal);border:1px solid var(--teal2);border-radius:3px;padding:3px 8px">Supported</span>
                </div>
                <div class="crow" data-ws-row data-id="claim-027" data-note="Reads as a procedural coverage claim. It holds for the listed cleaning agents, but the interval for shared-use accessories is left unspecified." data-claim="Cleaning instructions cover high-touch surfaces after each patient use." data-verdict="Partial" data-passage="The manual specifies approved cleaning agents but does not define the interval for accessories in shared clinical settings." data-source="Maintenance manual / section 7.2" data-color="#E3A32C" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:13px 16px;background:var(--surface-paper)">
                  <span style="display:block"><strong style="display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--t1);font-weight:500">Cleaning instructions cover high-touch surfaces after each patient use.</strong><small style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t4)">claim-027 / Maintenance manual / section 7.2</small></span>
