              <h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;color:var(--t1);margin-top:8px;max-width:640px">Each claim is matched only against the 47 files you supplied, never the open web.</h3>
              <div style="margin-top:10px;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--teal)">matching · claim-018: device packaging identifies the imported model and manufacturer lot</div>
              <div style="margin-top:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;background:var(--rulesoft);border:1px solid var(--rulesoft);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;background:var(--surface-paper)">
                  <span style="flex:1;min-width:0"><strong style="display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--t1);font-weight:500">IFU-22 · Instructions for use</strong><small style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t4)">page 4 · model + lot reference</small></span>
                  <span style="width:120px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--rulesoft);overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0"><span style="display:block;height:100%;width:92%;background:var(--teal)"></span></span>
                  <span style="flex-shrink:0;width:74px;text-align:right;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--teal)">match</span>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;background:var(--surface-paper)">
                  <span style="flex:1;min-width:0"><strong style="display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--t1);font-weight:500">TR-09 · Bench test report</strong><small style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t4)">table 2 · performance data</small></span>
                  <span style="width:120px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--rulesoft);overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0"><span style="display:block;height:100%;width:78%;background:var(--teal)"></span></span>
                  <span style="flex-shrink:0;width:74px;text-align:right;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--teal)">match</span>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;background:var(--surface-paper)">
                  <span style="flex:1;min-width:0"><strong style="display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--t1);font-weight:500">Maintenance manual</strong><small style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t4)">section 7.2 · cleaning agents</small></span>
                  <span style="width:120px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--rulesoft);overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0"><span style="display:block;height:100%;width:54%;background:var(--gold)"></span></span>
                  <span style="flex-shrink:0;width:74px;text-align:right;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--gold)">partial</span>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;background:var(--surface-paper)">
                  <span style="flex:1;min-width:0"><strong style="display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--t1);font-weight:500">DoC-3 · Declaration of conformity</strong><small style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t4)">indexed · no direct hit</small></span>
                  <span style="width:120px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--rulesoft);overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0"><span style="display:block;height:100%;width:14%;background:var(--t3)"></span></span>
                  <span style="flex-shrink:0;width:74px;text-align:right;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--t3)">silent</span>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;background:var(--surface-paper)">
                  <span style="flex:1;min-width:0"><strong style="display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--t1);font-weight:500">Carton label pack · artwork</strong><small style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t4)">no French warning found</small></span>
                  <span style="width:120px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--rulesoft);overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0"><span style="display:block;height:100%;width:6%;background:var(--t3)"></span></span>
